        <activityName xml:lang="en">Polystyrene, extruded (XPS), market mix, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Polystyrene, extruded (XPS), market mix, at regional storage
pipeline transport is modelled as freight train transport.;
UUID: a19acab4-2d8d-34d1-865f-46311ede87f9
This data set accounts for 1 kg of XPS at the regional storage. 45% are from import, 55% are produced in Switzerland. The imported share is weighted with a factor of 1.1. The average transport distance is 700 km. 6% are delievered by freight train, 92% by lorry and 2% by barge. Packaging material added according to dataset rock wool, packed, at plant/kg/CH, disposal of packaging material included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: undefined
Time period: undefined
Production volume: CH consumption of XPS: 18 kt (import and domestic production)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a19acab4-2d8d-34d1-865f-46311ede87f9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
